# Test fixtures that LOOK like projects. `monodocs` discovers projects by
# manifest (Cargo.toml / package.json / kcl.mod / nupm.nuon), so its tests ship
# a miniature polyglot workspace. Those manifests are data, not projects: nx's
# crate inference (tools/nx/rust-targets.ts, glob `*/**/Cargo.toml`) otherwise
# turns them into graph nodes and `nx show projects` fails outright, and a
# `rust`-tagged node would hand `cargo --package rust-app` — not a workspace
# member — to `just check-rust-affected`.
apps/monodocs/cli/tests/fixtures
